    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If... everything could be chosen again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will our final outcome be... different?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2041, as a detective, you receive an invitation from a renowned scientist named &quot;Jody&quot;. When you arrive at Jody's residence according to the contents of the letter, you only have time to attend the doctor's funeral. As a result, you are caught up in a series of unsettling mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown invitation from the deceased?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious girl who suddenly appeared?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange machine buzzing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The terrifying truth intertwined in a spiral?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worry, suffer, struggle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give everything for the so-called 'perfect ending' that you don't even know if exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only in this way can we end this tragic 'fate'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only in this way can we welcome the 'future' that you have hoped for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is expected to last 5-7 hours and contains a large number of reasoning elements. The names of people, places, and organizations that appear in the game are all fictional settings and should not be elevated to reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If... everything could be chosen again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will our final outcome be... different?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2041, as a detective, you receive an invitation from a renowned scientist named &quot;Jody&quot;. When you arrive at Jody's residence according to the contents of the letter, you only have time to attend the doctor's funeral. As a result, you are caught up in a series of unsettling mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown invitation from the deceased?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious girl who suddenly appeared?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange machine buzzing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The terrifying truth intertwined in a spiral?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worry, suffer, struggle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give everything for the so-called 'perfect ending' that you don't even know if exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only in this way can we end this tragic 'fate'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only in this way can we welcome the 'future' that you have hoped for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is expected to last 5-7 hours and contains a large number of reasoning elements. The names of people, places, and organizations that appear in the game are all fictional settings and should not be elevated to reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
